    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a cold, blood-stained prison cell with no memory of how you got there but the screams echoing through the halls make one thing clear: you need to escape!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/539f59107c0db178dbcf531f9bc30e3f.poster.avif?t=1744698231\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/539f59107c0db178dbcf531f9bc30e3f.webm?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/539f59107c0db178dbcf531f9bc30e3f.mp4?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br> Explore the twisted depths of the\u00a0Virexon Pharmaceuticals research facility, where failed experiments roam and dark secrets lurk behind every locked door.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/b3c7deccb5266327e6b93aa7d9cbdc61.poster.avif?t=1744698231\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/b3c7deccb5266327e6b93aa7d9cbdc61.webm?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/b3c7deccb5266327e6b93aa7d9cbdc61.mp4?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> Face relentless hordes of the undead, terrifying bosses, and cryptic puzzles standing between you and freedom. Survive the nightmare alone or team up with up to 3 friends in intense online co-op. Will you uncover the truth or become part of the experiment?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/fa83eb87d97e7285280f20c86451a0bb.poster.avif?t=1744698231\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/fa83eb87d97e7285280f20c86451a0bb.webm?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/fa83eb87d97e7285280f20c86451a0bb.mp4?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
