"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/fa83eb87d97e7285280f20c86451a0bb.poster.avif?t=1744698231\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/fa83eb87d97e7285280f20c86451a0bb.webm?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/fa83eb87d97e7285280f20c86451a0bb.mp4?t=1744698231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
